{
 "gse": "GSE126081",
 "notes": "Strain collection, all in LB to OD ~0.2 (mid_exponential inferred). Unmodified strains taken as reference genotype and controls (plain growth, no treatment). Strains named <gene>-<letter> (metL-D, ptsI-E, ...) and Perfeito-Clone-*, TA014/TA464 look like engineered or evolved derivatives but the text does not say what they are: genotype_class, is_control and global_regulator_perturbed left out for them. strain_group only for well-known names (K-12 lab strains, CFT073/EC958 UPEC, H10407 ETEC, ECOR natural isolates); others (IAI, NILS, ZG, ATCC, HS, ED1a, APEC01, UTI 83972 ...) left empty. Temperature and aeration not stated. WT re-read: the named lab strains and isolates are unmodified, so wild_type; the unexplained derivatives stay unlabelled.",
 "default": {
  "base_medium": {
   "v": "LB",
   "b": "stated",
   "q": "Samples were grown in LB media until an O.D. concentration of about 0.2"
  },
